  (text "Module 5 V: pins 2-12 (+5V_MOD). GND: 1-11, 39-40, 55-56, 105-108, 157-158, 199-200.\nSODIMM pin to ball: pinmap/icesugar-pro-sodimm.csv. Signal per pin: pinmap/carrier-assign.csv.\nTwo schematic labels on the module are misnamed (PT62D is ball C13 = PT60B; PT58D is C12 = PT56B);\nthe balls are what count, and they are used here."
    (at 40 40 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "758bdf55-a238-4b2a-a0cd-7e96562eef9b")))
